Have you identified any specific recording in which this occur? And, in that case, have you looked at the meta data from part 1 to 4 to check that everything looks normal? I have tested GGIR with movisens Move 4 files, and I think all the test files from Movisens we have used were from the model Move 4. It might be that Move 3 stores the data differently and that might be producing this issue. Have you been able to process data from other Move 3 devices with no issues?

Best,
